figdown 0.1 block
group g "G"
band "R" 35..15% in=g
band "R" 15% in=g from=0 to=15
band "R" 15%
band "R" 15% in=g extend=diagonal
band "R" 15..15% in=g
band "R" 15% in=ghost
# 0.1 (`BAND-LABEL-STATUS`): the label is mandatory and quoted, and comes first
band 15% in=g
# `RANGE-SPELLING`: the hyphen range is RETIRED — one range grammar, `..`.
band "R" 15-35% in=g
